# The Cloudflare Tunnel's token, read by the cloudflared container. It is the tunnel's
# whole credential: whoever holds it can run a connector for the tunnel, so it lives only
# here, encrypted. Copy it from the tunnel's page in the Cloudflare dashboard (Zero Trust,
# Networks, Tunnels), and replace it there if it ever leaks (docs/DEPLOY.md, Rotating a key).
TUNNEL_TOKEN=
